<section class="section advice" aria-labelledby="advice-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">Practical advice</p><h2 id="advice-title">Before you replace it,<br />know what it needs.</h2><p>Assess workload, condition and supportability before recommending a purchase.</p><span class="illustrative-badge">Illustrative</span></div><div class="advice-examples"><article><h3>Keep.</h3><p>Still right for the job? Keep it.</p></article><article><h3>Upgrade.</h3><p>A specific bottleneck? Check the upgrade.</p></article><article><h3>Replace.</h3><p>No sensible supported path? Replace it to fit the workload.</p></article><p class="advice-limit">A rule of thumb, not a diagnosis. Illustrative decisions, not a client case study.</p></div></section>
